AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::setAuthorizedLiquidationPeriphery()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when periphery is zero address
│   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketInvalidInput
└── when owner supplies a nonzero periphery
    ├── it should set and clear authorizedLiquidationPeriphery
    ├── it should emit SetAuthorizedLiquidationPeriphery even when the value is unchanged
    ├── it should not change market accounting or custody
    ├── it should remain callable while paused or frozen
    └── it should not enable public liquidation on the credit market
